He Dug a Secret Underground Home Beneath the Roots of a 1,000 Year Old Tree | Start to Finish This man is building a hidden underground home beneath a massive 1,000-year-old tree! @OlikaBushcraft In this video, we witness the incredible project of a man who chose to live in harmony with nature. Under a massive, historic tree with roots hundreds of years old, he is building a hidden underground shelter entirely by hand and with natural materials. You will follow the entire process step by step, from digging the earth and shaping the interior to installing a ventilation system and creating a comfortable living space. This project is not just about building a shelter; it's also a demonstration of respecting nature and living in harmony with it. Built without damaging the tree's roots and preserving its natural texture, this structure is a perfect combination of patience, effort, and creativity. 📌 What's in the video: ✅ Excavation work for the underground house ✅ Construction of walls and roof with natural materials ✅ Interior design and decoration ✅ The magnificent finished result. If you are interested in bushcraft, off-grid living, natural structures, and survival projects, this video is for you! You'll be surprised when you see the result at the end of the video! 👍 Don't forget to like the video, share your thoughts in the comments, and subscribe to the channel for more nature projects! Olika Bushcraft Youtube : 
