In this video, a plot of land that had sat empty for years is transformed from start to finish into a massive workshop. First, the ground is prepared and foundation connections are installed; then, the large timber framework begins to rise step by step. What starts as a challenging construction process in a snow-covered open area evolves into a vast workspace through the erection of walls, the installation of roof trusses and metal cladding, and the completion of the interior. Requiring care, hard work, and planning at every stage, this project demonstrates how a completely empty plot of land is turned into a functional and robust workshop.

